name show2e
category Package
revision 15878
shortdesc Variants of \show for LaTeX2e
relocated 1
longdesc This small package aims at making debugging (especially in an
longdesc interactive way) easier, by providing \show variants suited to
longdesc LaTeX2e commands (whether with optional arguments or robust)
longdesc and environments. The variant commands also display the
longdesc internal macros used by such commands, if any. The \showcs
longdesc variant helps with macros with exotic names.
runfiles size=1
